  "description": "Although it was a political marriage, Ji-Young, who truly loved Se-Jun, had her face crushed by Se-Jun during their first-year anniversary trip, falling into the sea. When she finally regained consciousness, she was a completely different person. Ji-Young returned as \"Eun Seol-Lin\" with the man who gave her a new life, Cha Eun-Hyeok. Seol-Lin resolved to seek revenge on all those who participated in her murder, holding hands with Eun-Hyeok, who had given her life.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
